  - name: saturation
    description: 3 ..FV....... Saturation mapping (RGB -> RGB)
  - name: absolute
    description: 4 ..FV....... Absolute colorimetric clipping
  - name: desaturate
    description: 5 ..FV....... Colorimetrically desaturate colors towards white
  - name: darken
    description: 6 ..FV....... Colorimetric clip with bias towards darkening image to fit gamut
  - name: warn
    description: 7 ..FV....... Highlight out-of-gamut colors
  - name: linear
    description: 8 ..FV....... Linearly reduce chromaticity to fit gamut
